{
  "id": "perspective",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [
    "conversation"
  ],
  "description": "The deictic ORIGIN under the meaning ladder: person (pronoun tally) + tense (verb-morphology) + interiority-access (distinct minds) are three structural counts on one Origin node; POV and focalization are derived from them (robust by inheritance); reliability reuses suspect-witness trust on the Origin. classify_perspective derives person/POV/focalization from the counts.",
  "microtheory": {
    "name": "perspective",
    "description": "narrative deictic origin: person/POV/focalization/tense/reliability"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "local_id": 1,
      "type": "Concept",
      "attrs": {
        "name": "perspective",
        "description": "NOT another rung on the displacement ladder but the ORIGIN the ladder is measured FROM: displacement F-L is only defined relative to a zero-point, and perspective is that narrative deictic center. A four-coordinate Origin node \u2014 I (person), here (vantage), now (tense), whose-eyes (focalization) \u2014 so person/tense/focalization are axes of ONE origin, which is why it sits UNDER the meaning ladder. Same frame-relativity as projection: hold the structure once, view it through a Viewpoint."
      }
    },
    {
      "local_id": 2,
      "type": "Concept",
      "attrs": {
        "name": "narrative_person",
        "description": "Pure pronoun-class tally on the narration: I/we dominant with the narrator a story participant = FIRST; you-addressed = SECOND; he/she/they/names with the narrator absent = THIRD. Structural (a marker count like the simile-marker test), robust without outside perception."
      }
    },
    {
      "local_id": 3,
      "type": "Concept",
      "attrs": {
        "name": "point_of_view",
        "description": "Derived (not separately observed) as an Argmax over person-dominance x interiority-breadth: first-person + interiority to the narrator = first-person; third + interiority to one mind = third-limited; third + interiority to >=2 minds = third-omniscient; third + zero interiority = objective."
      }
    },
    {
      "local_id": 4,
      "type": "Concept",
      "attrs": {
        "name": "focalization",
        "description": "Genette whose-eyes, mapped off the interiority-breadth axis: internal<->limited (one mind field), zero<->omniscient (unrestricted), external<->objective (no interior). Focalization is the per-PASSAGE local origin; POV is the Argmax over the segments (work-level aggregate) \u2014 the same local-vs-global order-N pattern."
      }
    },
    {
      "local_id": 5,
      "type": "Concept",
      "attrs": {
        "name": "narration_tense",
        "description": "Verb-morphology tally over main-clause verbs (past/present/future) = the now coordinate: the relation between narrating-now and narrated-now. Structural."
      }
    },
    {
      "local_id": 6,
      "type": "Concept",
      "attrs": {
        "name": "narrator_reliability",
        "description": "No new machinery: the narrator is just another witness node, so the suspect-witness rule (believe = trust x corroboration, + refute) points at the Origin node; unreliability falls out as low narrator-trust when the narration is contradicted by depicted events, self-contradiction, or interiority it inadvertently betrays (the Humpty pattern)."
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [],
